      "loyalty": null,
      "mana_cost": "{G}",
      "name": "Veil of Summer",
      "oracle_id": "002965be-a36f-4a09-9ce0-c6535bca1703",
      "oracle_text": "Draw a card if an opponent has cast a blue or black spell this turn. Spells you control can't be countered this turn. You and permanents you control gain hexproof from blue and from black until end of turn. (You and they can't be the targets of blue or black spells or abilities your opponents control.)",
      "power": null,
      "produced_mana": [],
      "released_at": "2019-07-12",
      "toughness": null,
      "type_line": "Instant"
    }
  ],
  "fixture_kind": "public_exact-list_card_data",
  "rulings": [
    {
      "comment": "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target your spells after Veil of Summer resolves. When that spell or ability resolves, your spell won't be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen.",
      "oracle_id": "002965be-a36f-4a09-9ce0-c6535bca1703",
      "published_at": "2019-07-12",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If your opponents have cast more than one blue or black spell, you still draw only one card as Veil of Summer resolves.",
      "oracle_id": "002965be-a36f-4a09-9ce0-c6535bca1703",
      "published_at": "2019-07-12",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Veil of Summer has no effect until it resolves. It can be countered.",
      "oracle_id": "002965be-a36f-4a09-9ce0-c6535bca1703",
      "published_at": "2019-07-12",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the target opponent can discard only one card or can\u2019t discard any cards, they still mill a card and lose 1 life, and you gain 1 life.",
      "oracle_id": "0a88d1b1-ac3c-41da-b3f5-b689af0e45d7",
      "published_at": "2020-09-25",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If the player has no cards in their hand or no cards in their library, the other effect still happens.",
      "oracle_id": "36ee4179-83a1-472a-a48c-394c4c0457bc",
      "published_at": "2011-06-01",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "A player's \"opening hand\" is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player's opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.",
      "oracle_id": "492e0e6c-8c27-4376-938b-f8a8b6205810",
